Adv[Game 1: indistinguishability from game 11] <= (3 * N1 * N2 + 7.5 * N2^2) / |mac_key| + Adv[Game 11: indistinguishability from game 11]
Adv[Game 12: indistinguishability from game 18, non_unique] <= Pr[Game 13: non_unique] + Adv[Game 13: indistinguishability from game 18]
Pr[Game 13: non_unique] <= 0
Adv[Game 13: indistinguishability from game 18] <= Adv[Game 18: indistinguishability from game 18]
